#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Some Muslims moved to Madinah before this departure; the selected passage also describes Abu Bakr waiting to accompany the Prophet ﷺ."
msgstr "Qaar ka mid ah muslimiinta ayaa u guuray Madiinah bixitaankan ka hor; qoraalka la xushay wuxuu sidoo kale sharraxayaa Abu Bakar oo sugayay inuu raaco Nebiga ﷺ."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected passage describes provisions and Asma bint Abi Bakr using part of her waist-belt to tie the bag."
msgstr "Qoraalka la xushay wuxuu sharraxayaa sahayda iyo Asma bint Abi Bakar oo isticmaashay qayb ka mid ah dhex-xidhkeeda si ay u xidho boorsada."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected passage supports the cave on Mount Thawr and three nights."
msgstr "Qoraalka la xushay wuxuu taageerayaa godka ku yaal Buurta Thawr iyo saddexda habeen."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "It does not establish coordinates, dimensions, or the exact arrangement of a visual model."
msgstr "Ma caddaynayo isku-duwayaasha, cabbirrada, ama qaabka saxda ah ee naqshadda muuqaalka ah."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected passage describes ‘Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr bringing news of plans against the two companions after darkness."
msgstr "Qoraalka la doortay wuxuu sharraxayaa in ‘Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr uu u keenay wararka ku saabsan qorshayaasha ka dhanka ah labada saaxiib markii ay madoobaatay."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "It does not establish modern clock times or a mapped trail."
msgstr "Ma go'aaminayo saacado casri ah ama marin khariidad ku calaamadsan."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected passage connects ‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah with tending sheep and making milk available during the three nights."
msgstr "Qoraalka la doortay wuxuu xiriirinayaa ‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah iyo la-dhaqidda idaha iyo u diyaarinta caanaha muddadii saddexda habeen ahayd."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected passage describes hiring a skilled guide, entrusting him with two riding animals, and arranging the meeting at Thawr."
msgstr "Qoraalka la doortay wuxuu sharraxayaa kireysashada hage xirfad leh, ku aaminidda laba neef oo gaadiid ah, iyo ballanta kulanka ee Buur Thawr."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected passage does not supply the guide’s personal name or a precise route."
msgstr "Qoraalka la doortay ma bixinayo magaca rasmiga ah ee hagaha ama marin sax ah."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected passage says that ‘Amir and the guide went with them and that the guide led them by the coastal way."
msgstr "Qoraalka la doortay wuxuu sheegayaa in ‘Amir iyo haguhu ay raaceen iyaga, haguhuna uu ku hoggaamiyey jidka xeebta."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "It does not establish every turn, distance, stopping place, or exact GPS route."
msgstr "Ma go'aaminayo leexasho kasta, masaafo, meelaha la istaago, ama marin GPS oo sax ah."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Abu Bakr’s account records concern about being seen and the Prophet’s reassurance."
msgstr "Wariyaha Abu Bakr wuxuu xusayaa welwelka laga qabay in la arko iyo u xaqiijinta Nabiga ee isaga."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Quran"
msgstr "Qur'aanka"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected extract recalls the two in the cave and the reassurance to the companion."
msgstr "Qoraalka la doortay wuxuu xusuusinayaa labadii ku jiray godka iyo u xaqiijinta saaxiibka."

