#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Kathir’s commentary on the Turath page explains the reassurance through Allah’s help, support, and strengthening."
msgstr "Sharraxaadda Ibn Kathir ee ku taal bogga Turath waxay ku sharraxaysaa xasiloonida gargaarka, taageerada, iyo xoojinta Alle."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected arrival account describes people waiting and the stay among Bani ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf."
msgstr "Wariyaha imaatinka ee la doortay wuxuu sharraxayaa dadka sugaya iyo joogitaankii dhexdiisa Bani ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected passage describes the mosque site and the Prophet ﷺ carrying bricks with the builders."
msgstr "Qoraalka la doortay wuxuu sharraxayaa goobta masjidka iyo Nabiga ﷺ oo lebenka la xambaarayay dhisayaasha."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "It does not establish the exact appearance of buildings in the scene."
msgstr "Ma go'aaminayo muuqaalka saxda ah ee dhismayaasha ku dhex jira goobta."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Al-Sa‘di"
msgstr "Al-Sa‘di"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Attribution recorded in the cited work"
msgstr "Nisbada waxay ku qoran tahay shaqada la soo xigtay"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Turath book_id/page_id retrieved from category 24; publication approval pending"
msgstr "Turath book_id/page_id waxaa laga soo qaatay qaybta 24; oggolaanshaha daabacaadda ayaa weli dhiman"

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected evidence does not establish an exact route. It describes a coastal way, while this overview is schematic rather than a measured itinerary."
msgstr "Caddaynta la doortay ma go'aaminayso marin sax ah. Waxay sharraxaysaa jidka xeebta, halka dulmarkani uu yahay mid guud oo aan ahayn marin la qiyaasay."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "They hired a skilled guide, entrusted him with two riding animals, and arranged to meet him at Thawr. The account says he led them by the coastal way."
msgstr "Waxay kireysteen hage xirfad leh, waxay ku aamineen laba neef oo gaadiid ah, waxayna ku ballameen inay kula kulmaan Thawr. Wariyaha wuxuu sheegayaa inuu ku hoggaamiyey jidka xeebta."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected account says that they remained in the cave for three nights."
msgstr "Wariyaha la doortay wuxuu sheegayaa inay godka ku jireen saddex habeen."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "The preparations account describes provisions packed in a bag and Asma bint Abi Bakr using part of her waist-belt to tie its opening."
msgstr "Wariyaha u diyaargarowga wuxuu sharraxayaa sahayda lagu riday boorsada iyo Asma bint Abi Bakr oo u isticmaashay qayb ka mid ah suunkeeda si ay ugu xirto afkeeda."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "The arrival account describes Muslims waiting, the stay among Bani ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf, and later building work at the mosque site."
msgstr "Wariyaha imaatinka wuxuu sharraxayaa Muslimiinta sugaya, joogitaankii dhexdiisa Bani ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf, iyo markii dambe shaqadii dhismaha ee goobta masjidka."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "The selected evidence does not establish an answer to that question. The available source records are shown below."
msgstr "Caddaynta la doortay ma go'aaminayso jawaabta su'aashaas. Diiwaannada ilaha ee la heli karo ayaa hoos ku qoran."

