#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah and the guide went with them when they continued, and the guide led them by the coastal way. The guide’s personal name and the precise route are not established here."
msgstr "‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah iyo haguhu waxay raaceen iyaga markay sii wadeen safarka, haguhuna wuxuu ku hoggaamiyey jidka xeebta. Magaca rasmiga ah ee hagaha iyo marinka saxda ah halkan laguma go'aamin."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "‘Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr brought news of plans against them after darkness and returned to Makkah before daybreak."
msgstr "‘Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr wuxuu u keeni jiray wararka ku saabsan qorshayaasha laga maleegayo markay madoobaato, wuxuuna ku laaban jiray Makkah ka hor waaberiga."

#: src/lib/guide-provider.js
#, ai
msgid "‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah tended the flock and brought milk near the cave during the three nights."
msgstr "‘Aamir ibn Fuhayrah wuxuu daajinayay adhiga, wuxuuna caano u keeni jiray godka agtiisa saddexdii habeenba."

