#, ai
msgid "draft — scholarly and publication review pending"
msgstr "qabyo — dib-u-eegista aqooneed iyo tan daabacaadda ayaa dhiman"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah provided another kind of help. He tended sheep and brought them near after nightfall, making milk available. The account describes this on each of the three nights."
msgstr "‘Aamir ibn Fuhayrah wuxuu bixiyay gargaar nooc kale ah. Wuxuu daajin jiray ari, wuxuuna u soo dhoweyn jiray markay habeenka madoobaato, isagoo caano u diyaarinaya. Warbixintu waxay sidaas ku tilmaamaysaa mid kasta oo ka mid ah saddexda habeen."

