#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "In Ibn Ishaq’s account, “as it reached me,” ‘Ali stayed behind for another reason too. People in Makkah had left their valuables with the Prophet ﷺ for safekeeping, knowing his honesty; the report says ‘Ali was to return their deposits."
msgstr "Sida ku jirta werinta Ibnu Isxaaq, isagoo leh “sida la ii soo gaarsiiyey”, Cali wuxuu uga haray sabab kale. Reer Makka waxay hantidooda ammaan ahaan ugu dhiibi jireen Nebiga ﷺ, maadaama ay yaqaaneen aaminnimadiisa; werintu waxay sheegaysaa in Cali uu u celin lahaa wixii ay u dhiibteen."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "Further on they stopped at the tent of Umm Ma‘bad of Khuza‘ah and asked for hospitality. She said they had no food and no milk-giving ewe."
msgstr "Dabadeed jidka ayay ku hakadeen teendhada Ummu Macbad ee reer Khuzaaca, martigelinna way weyddiisteen. Waxay tidhi ma haystaan cunto iyo lax caano laga liso toona."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "The report says the Prophet ﷺ called for one of her sheep, passed his hand over its udder and called on Allah. He milked it into a large vessel until it frothed, and said: drink, Umm Ma‘bad. Ibn Kathir notes that her story is well known and comes through routes that strengthen one another."
msgstr "Werintu waxay sheegaysaa in Nebigu ﷺ dalbaday mid ka mid ah idaha ay lahayd, candhadeeda gacanta ku salaaxay oo Alle baryay. Wuxuu ku lisay weel weyn ilaa ay xumbo samaysay, wuxuuna yidhi: “Cab, Ummu Macbad.” Ibnu Kathiir wuxuu xusay in sheekadeedu caan tahay, lagana weriyey waddooyin werineed oo is xoojiya."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "According to ‘Urwa, he stayed among them for a few more than ten nights. There he founded the mosque that the account calls the one founded on piety, and he prayed in it."
msgstr "Sida ku jirta werinta Curwa, wuxuu dhex joogay dhowr habeen oo ka badan toban. Halkaas ayuu ka dhisay masaajidka ay werintu ku tilmaantay mid lagu aasaasay Alle ka cabsasho, wuuna ku tukaday."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
msgid "They stopped at Umm Ma‘bad’s tent. She said they had no food or milk-giving ewe; the report then describes milk from one of her sheep."
msgstr "Waxay ku hakadeen teendhada Ummu Macbad. Waxay tidhi ma haystaan cunto iyo lax caano laga liso toona; dabadeed werintu waxay tilmaamaysaa in mid ka mid ah idaheeda caano laga lisay."

